      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS LEOPATRA NZ (5) made a good return after nearly four months when she came from the back row for second here last week. Had ended last campaign with back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance, one of those coming in the Diamond Classic. Returns to the front row and has scored when second-up before so can progress enough to win. SKINNY DIPPIN NZ (12) might need some luck from a back row draw but she is progressing well having led to beat Miss Leopatra last week, her second success in three starts here off a spell. WAR CRY NZ (3) showed improvement when she placed here last start and should be fitter again third-up. Can enjoy a lovely run from this draw. Contender. A PRECIOUS GEM (6) draws a little wider but took her record at this circuit and distance to two from three when she won the Westbred 3F Classic last start. Must respect.",
